&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE WORK:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Customer Success Manager plays a key role in driving revenue, product adoption and retention across the Ripple Treasury customer base in EMEA. Acting as a trusted advisor to Heads of Treasury, Finance leaders and CFOs, the CSM will own a portfolio of strategic enterprise accounts — deepening relationships, accelerating adoption of Ripple Treasury&#39;s cash, liquidity, forecasting, payments, netting, reconciliation capabilities, and supporting expansion and renewal opportunities across Ripple&#39;s product suite&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a portfolio of strategic enterprise treasury accounts across EMEA, with responsibility for adoption, retention, satisfaction and growth outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a deep understanding of each customer&#39;s treasury organisation, technical landscape, internal decision-making, aspirations and needs — mapping their workflows to measurable success outcomes on the Ripple Treasury platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted, senior-level relationships with Heads of Treasury, Finance leaders and CFOs, serving as an advisor and Ripple advocate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run QBRs and executive-level success reviews; conduct financial, business and value analysis tied to customer targets such as cost reduction, forecasting accuracy and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
