&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with data and metrics, even if you do not build the underlying pipelines. You know how to ask Data Science the right questions. Then, you turn their output into a story.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication; able to synthesize complexity into something leadership can act on quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized, low-ego, and energized by making other people&#39;s work easier and more coherent&lt;/li&gt;
