&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE WORK:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a senior product leader to shape the future of payments and financial applications on the XRP Ledger.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll own product strategy and execution across areas such as stablecoin payments, on-chain liquidity and foreign exchange, and emerging forms of programmable commerce. You’ll work at the intersection of blockchain infrastructure, financial markets, and real-world customer needs - turning new capabilities into products and experiences that can achieve meaningful adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly cross-functional role. You’ll work closely with engineering, business development, ecosystem partners, and customers to identify the most important problems to solve, develop a clear product strategy, and drive complex initiatives from concept through market adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own product strategy and roadmap for key payments and on-chain financial capabilities on the XRP Ledger&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and prioritize opportunities where blockchain infrastructure can meaningfully improve how value is exchanged, converted, and settled&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop product-market fit hypotheses and validate them through customer discovery, market research, product data, and real-world usage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Engineering to translate market and customer needs into scalable product and protocol capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with financial institutions, payment providers, liquidity providers, developers, and other ecosystem participants to understand workflows and adoption barriers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex cross-functional initiatives spanning Product, Engineering, Business Development, and external partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the capabilities and ecosystem requirements needed to deliver compelling end-to-end customer experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate technical, commercial, and market tradeoffs to drive clear decisions and maintain momentum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the product strategy internally and externally with customers, partners, and the broader ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
