&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL BRING:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant product management experience building payments, fintech, financial infrastructure, trading, or other technically complex products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to define product strategy and lead ambiguous, high-impact initiatives from discovery through launch and adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional leadership skills, with a track record of driving alignment across technical and commercial organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical fluency and experience working closely with engineering teams on backend, infrastructure, API, or protocol-level products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep customer orientation and the ability to translate complex financial workflows into clear product opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong systems thinking and judgment across product, technology, market dynamics, and go-to-market considerations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication, particularly when simplifying complex problems and driving decisions across diverse stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating in a fast-moving environment where the market, technology, and customer needs are still evolving&lt;/li&gt;
