&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Ripple, we’re building a world where value moves like information does today. It’s big, it’s bold, and we’re already doing it. Through our crypto solutions for financial institutions, businesses, governments and developers, we are improving the global financial system and creating greater economic fairness and opportunity for more people, in more places around the world. And we get to do the best work of our career and grow our skills surrounded by colleagues who have our backs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you’re ready to see your impact and unlock incredible career growth opportunities, join us, and build real world value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE WORK:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency in either Spanish or Portuguese required; proficiency in both is a strong plus.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Field Marketing Specialist, you will be responsible for planning, executing, and optimizing regional field marketing initiatives and ABM campaigns for your territory. You&#39;ll collaborate closely with sales, marketing, and partner teams to design high-impact programs that engage target accounts, accelerate the sales cycle, and build Ripple Treasury&#39;s presence in key markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is both strategic and hands-on, requiring creativity, strong analytical skills, and a passion for delivering results. You&#39;ll own your regional budget to host intimate executive experiences, manage our presence at industry events, execute targeted campaigns that drive measurable pipeline growth, and design creative engagement strategies that break through the noise with high-value prospects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Field Marketing Strategy and Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute a regional field marketing strategy aligned with global marketing objectives and sales goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan, manage, and host regional events, including executive dinners, roundtables, workshops, and webinars to engage prospects and customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute targeted campaigns to drive awareness, engagement, and pipeline growth in your territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and manage regional marketing budget to maximize ROI and pipeline impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Ripple Treasury at key industry conferences and trade associations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Account-Based Marketing (ABM)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement ABM strategies to support high-value accounts, creating personalized programs to drive engagement and conversions with CFOs and Treasurers at enterprise companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Account Executives to identify target accounts, tailor messaging, and design account-specific campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop creative engagement tactics including direct mail campaigns, thoughtful gifting strategies, executive door openers, and memorable giveaways that resonate with finance executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with content and product marketing teams to develop assets such as landing pages, emails, and personalized outreach materials for ABM programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage Zoominfo intent data to identify buying signals and prioritize marketing investments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute multi-touch ABM plays that combine digital, direct mail, gifting, and event experiences to drive account progression&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with regional sales teams, product marketing, and the broader marketing organization to ensure alignment on campaign goals and messaging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Marketing Operations to ensure flawless campaign execution, tracking, and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide insights and feedback from the field to inform future marketing strategies and product positioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with global events team on large-scale conference presence and activations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Measurement and Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor the performance of field and ABM campaigns, analyzing metrics such as pipeline contribution, ROI, qualified contacts, and engagement rates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide detailed post-campaign reporting and actionable insights to sales leadership and marketing stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate campaign tracking in HubSpot/Salesforce with proper attribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously refine campaigns based on data-driven insights to optimize performance and outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
