&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE WORK:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Workplace Operations Specialist provides outstanding customer service and supports the daily management of the office, employee experience, vendor relations, and overall office and building maintenance. Ripple&#39;s Chicago office is currently under construction, and this role will be instrumental in standing it up from day one — helping develop the procedures, programming, and partnerships that set the foundation for a great workplace and employee experience. In this role, you have the strong ability to think on your feet, assigning an appropriate level of urgency to specific situations and working on projects independently. You are a diligent and resourceful problem-solver, able to iterate until the right solution is found. You can easily collaborate and communicate with internal teams and external partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
