&lt;li&gt;Client-side owner’s representative or in-house corporate real estate experience, ideally within a workplace or real estate team at a technology, financial services, fintech, or other fast-paced sector environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with international project delivery frameworks in addition to US-based delivery methods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with an outsourced PMO or managed services model.&lt;/li&gt;
